<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Inverse of P2 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a literary or artistic form type to the expressions it classifies. The original property has domain crm:E55_Type and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E55_Type and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."@en .
<http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P2i_is_type_of> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "P2i è tipo di"@it .
